 ### Added
 
+- Session authentication for staff, built with Livewire 4 full-page components and Bulma: login (remember me, per e-mail + IP lockout), registration, logout, forgot/reset password, and e-mail verification (`/home` requires a verified e-mail). Documented in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md#staff-access-sign-in).
+- Brazilian Portuguese UI by default (`APP_LOCALE=pt_BR`, `APP_FALLBACK_LOCALE=en`) with `lang/{en,pt_BR}/ui.php` translations; `APP_NAME=PegaFila` in `.env.example`.
+- App-wide password rule (`Password::defaults()`): 8+ characters with letters, mixed case and numbers.
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
