--- a/docs/business-rules.md
+++ b/docs/business-rules.md
@@ -65,6 +65,18 @@ ## User Administration
 | Remove user | Admin, owner | Cannot remove the owner; employees lose immediate access to the entity. |
 | Assign role | Admin, owner | Users are **separated by role**; employees receive granular permissions, not admin/owner role. |
 
+## Staff Access (sign-in)
+
+| Rule | Behaviour |
+| ---- | --------- |
+| Session sign-in | Staff sign in with e-mail + password; login and register are guest-only (signed-in users go to home). |
+| Password policy | One app-wide rule (`Password::defaults()`): at least 8 characters with letters, mixed case and numbers. |
+| Brute force | After 5 failed attempts per e-mail + IP, sign-in is locked for 60 seconds. Failures go to the audit channel without the e-mail address. |
+| Registration | Accounts start unverified. Home requires a verified e-mail; unverified users are sent to the verification notice. |
+| Verification link | Signed and throttled; it verifies only the logged-in user. A tampered link returns 403 and verifies nobody. |
+| Password reset | The form never reveals whether an e-mail is registered. A successful reset rotates `remember_token`. |
+| Logout | POST only; invalidates the session and regenerates the CSRF token. |
+
 ## Queue and Tickets
 
 ### Ticket
